  "body": "Today we held our weekly triage call (https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11290) and I have posted the meeting notes there. The next one is scheduled for May 22, 6pm CEST. Note that this is 1 week later in an Americas + Europe friendly time.\n\nPeople interested in attending the next call please respond here or reach out privately to @past, @cwilso, or the editors. We will be tagging issues for the next call again using [agenda+](https://github.com/whatwg/html/labels/agenda%2B) in all WHATWG repositories across [issues](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=issues) and [pull requests](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=pullrequests) and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to join us.",
